@startuml SD-02
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-02 / UC-02 - Record stock receipts
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Staff as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Select a book and submit received quantity
alt non-staff, unknown book or invalid quantity
system --> actor: Reject with specific reason; stock unchanged
else staff, existing book and positive integer quantity
note right of system
newAvailable = storedAvailable +
receivedQuantity. A single confirmed receipt
adds once; reservations are not changed.
end note
alt save succeeds
system --> actor: Show stored new available quantity and success
else save fails
system --> actor: Show error; no partial stock addition
end
end
@enduml
